 your tactical and lethal  equipment you'll have a support slot  that can carry larger score streak style  pickups like a chopper gunner  which is huge also if we slow down this  part it looks like equipment or even  special equipment can now be dropped by  zombies in the same way that they drop  nukes and max ammos  introduced for the first time in zombies  mode is the ability to end a match  designer kevin drew explains that  players can now complete a zombie  session  at the cost of playing a few more  intense rounds of zombies first  if you complete these tougher rounds  you'll get to x-fil safely and call it a  day  other big news includes weapon  progression carryover  in previous black ops games zombies mode  had its own progression and prestige  system  and leveling up in zombies wouldn't  carry over into multiplayer  say goodbye to that lastly what's a  zombie's mode without its secrets  lead writer craig houston explained that  there will be a lot of intel to uncover  so much so that they've introduced a new  intel system that catalogs the  information you've acquired  making it simpler to put the pieces of  the puzzle together the requiem team  isn't the only team after the bunker  secrets we're warned that not everyone  is trustworthy and that all of this  intel will reveal all of the terrifying  secrets about the events that took place  decades ago  let's keep the conversation going in the  comments if you noticed something else  cool in the trailer or are just hyped to  play nocturnal toten again  let us know thanks for watching  [Music]
 

